	quest.24D25D43AD833305.title: "&2&l制作 Tier 1 管道"
	quest.28074A1033B6FFAC.quest_desc: [
		"&f电缆是将能量在发电机和机器之间传输所必需的。"
		"&aTier 1 Cables are made using &8Steel Nuggets &aand will allow you to connect your early setup, such as pumps and separators."
